---
/** Agenko agk-about section, short variant (counters/experience box removed). */
---

<!--======  Start About Section  ======-->
<section class="agk-about pt-130 pb-80" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xl-7">
                <!--=== Agk Content Box ===-->
                <div class="agk-content-box style-one mb-50 pf_fadeup">
                    <div class="section-title mb-20">
                        <span class="sub-title">Tentang Ricksite</span>
                        <h2>Bangun Solusi Digital
                        Sejak Hari Pertama</h2>
                    </div>
                    <p>Ricksite Studio bantu bisnis punya website, sistem custom, dan iklan digital yang beneran kepakai. Pendekatannya praktis dan fokus ke hasil, bukan teori.</p>
                <p>Buat kami website yang bagus itu diukur dari hasilnya: berapa banyak calon customer yang akhirnya chat dan jadi order.</p>
                <div class="agk-button mb-30">
                    <a href="#" data-rs-todo="about.html" class="theme-btn style-one">
                        <span class="text-flip">
                            <span class="text">TENTANG RICKSITE STUDIO</span>
                            <span class="text">TENTANG RICKSITE STUDIO</span>
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xl-5">
                <!--=== Agk Image Box ===-->
                <div class="agk-image-box style-one mb-50 pf_fadeup">
                    <div class="agk-image">
                        <img src="/assets/images/ricksite/pages/about1.svg" alt="">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section><!--======  End About Section  ======-->
